1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,406
Two rules follow.

2
00:00:01,406 --> 00:00:09,244
Direction: through the cold junction, the current flows from the metal that comes earlier in the series to the one that comes later.

3
00:00:09,244 --> 00:00:11,940
Through the hot junction it goes the other way.

4
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:25,507
And size: the further apart the two metals are in the list, the bigger the e m f. Antimony and bismuth sit at the two ends, so an antimony bismuth couple gives the biggest e m f of all.

